---Subject: [PATCH] Replace "My circle" with "Share to [circle name]" everywhere
---
---The answer form's privacy option already showed the active circle's
---name in some cases; extend that to the revealed-answer summary and
---history badges via a shared circleShareLabel() helper, so the
---generic "My circle" label only appears as a fallback when no circle
---is selected.
